# Setup

$ bluetoothctl
[bluetooth] # power on
[bluetooth] # agent on
[bluetooth] # default-agent
[bluetooth] # scan on
...put device in pairing mode and wait [hex-address] to appear here...
[bluetooth] # pair [hex-address]
[bluetooth] # connect [hex-address]

# Debug

bluetoothctl devices [Paired/Bonded/Trusted/Connected]

# Connect

$ bluetoothctl
[bluetoothctl] #
...put device in pairing mode and interact with it (e.g. press keys)...
[agent] Authorize service <uuid> (yes/no): yes
